{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna Tactics</strong> is a turn-based tactical game that blends the strategic depth of classic RPGs with the unpredictability and nuance of tabletop systems. Inspired by D&amp;D 5e rules, each battle is a challenge where positioning, abilities, and planning are just as important as brute strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical System</strong>: Control a team of heroes on maps, where every move can determine victory or defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Inspired by D&amp;D 5e</strong>: HP, MP, attacks, spells, potions, modifiers \u2014 all faithfully adapted from traditional RPG mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression</strong>: Level up, allocate attributes, learn new abilities, and shape your ideal tactical strategy.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MOON'S WHISPER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760410/e4b8a143dac97e3c7db0f351bd3452322ab524fa.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760410?t=1751732582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760410/3a8d898f6bd654f0935e2b80c384d980dc98cf63/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751732582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760410/38df0e16e72ad408b20de56800bfd91455ef588f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751732582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760410/38df0e16e72ad408b20de56800bfd91455ef588f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751732582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna Tactics<